{
  "_comment": "Review-only seed and domain examples. Not a BDP transaction/import request. IDs/revisions are placeholders. Self-typed Type plus ConformsTo are a proposed trusted bootstrap, not an adopted installation mechanism. propertiesSchema copies must match the adjacent schema artifacts. Source endpoints are floating in this example only; exact owner snapshots determine conformance.",
